       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [],
        "textData": {
         "text": "I'm planning to open a big plan to contact artists and create opportunities in the future. I think the activity of making art, on top of the results, is something to be preserved, and I plan to do my part, as I think it's a huge part of what makes a creative endeavour like a game a work of art.",
