      "nodes": [
       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [],
        "textData": {
         "text": "If it were up to me, 1.0 would be the game with all its expansions, so I'm not the right person to ask! I think a good 1.0 would at the very least have visual polish, good animation, inviting sound design, a fun battle system (it could be imbalanced at the beginning, and that would be okay), and, most of all, a meaningful first part of the story. I also want all the mechanics to fit into place before release.",
         "decorations": [
          {
           "type": "ITALIC",
           "italicData": true
